  "description": "This bike was built for pure fun whether riding with your friends or flying solo. The Axios Pro is a BMX race-inspired bike that's great for beginning rides at the bike park, pump track or first laps at the BMX track.\nLightweight 6061 aluminum BMX frame – great for young riders and adults. 20.5\" top tube length fits riders 5'3\" to 5'8\" tall.\nDrivetrain features 170 mm one-piece Hi-Ten steel cranks with a 44T chainring and American loose ball bottom bracket.\n20” x 1.95” tires mounted on aluminum single wall 36H rims with aluminum ball bearer front hub and 16T cog freewheel ball bearing rear hub.\nHi-ten steel handlebar and fork, 50 mm stem, threadless 1-1/8\" external headset, and aluminum linear pull brakes and brake levers.",
